   Team is free while it is in beta. Every team on the beta will be told at
   least 30 days before any charging starts.

4. THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE

   The application bundles open-source components under their own licences,
   listed in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md with every release. Those licences govern
   those components.

5. YOUR DATA

   The application runs on your machine and sends no conversations and no code
   anywhere. Its only outbound connection is the check for updates against this
   repository; the embedding model and the search engine are inside the
   download, so nothing is fetched on first run.

   If you join a team server, what leaves a laptop is what that person opts in
   to share, with secrets redacted before it goes, and it goes to a server your
   organisation runs. Tokenome does not host a team server for customers and
   receives none of that data. We never train on your data.

   No licensing condition causes data to be deleted. If a subscription lapses,
   search, existing shares, updates to shared projects and deletes all keep
   working; only adding people and sharing a project for the first time pause.

